  "remaining_integration_work": [
    "Implement the fully doubled private fork composition using the frozen topology, endpoint authorities and pidfd child owners, including one identity-checked duplicate of each child pidfd needed by another component.",
    "The controller must fork and pidfd-bind guardian; guardian must adopt its prefork copy, create the lease, fork and pidfd-bind broker and worker; each final role must transfer only its assigned endpoints and close every other inherited copy.",
    "Implement one controller event loop for READY verification before guardian arm, parent reservation and ACK before every CONTINUE, CONSUMED verification, terminal reports and absolute-deadline cleanup.",
    "Integrate listener handoff and adoption, worker privilege drop and final seal, guardian-v2 authority consumption, full-size bootstrap and entry, and authenticated source closure.",
    "Run a separately authorized bounded Linux native qualification before any real checkpoint payload read or import, then re-run unchanged host, input, resource and real-import admission."
  ],
